 аксесуар, який підкреслить вашу унікальність. Ідеальний подарунок для себе чи близьких!</p>', 1, '2021-08-19 02:45:27', '["products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-14.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-10.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-9.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-15.webp"]', '["products\\/August2021\\/UWskhEBeI8kwRsMcV4tv.webp","products\\/August2021\\/11zkzfzg91wp4d6CpH9r.webp","products\\/August2021\\/gMSS3JbTQVPor7MaihhT.webp","products\\/August2021\\/oHU0n7D4yOZpDPNkbL4O.webp"]', '["products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-14.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-10.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-9.webp","products\\/2032\\/sumki-joko_joko-tpp-2-15.webp"]', 1230, 'Йоко-ТПП-2', 4, '', '', '', ',1,', ',51,', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, '', '', 0, 0, 0, '20327552818279', 'LA20327552818279VOKS', '2025-11-21 03:02:29', 9, '19 × 11 × 6 см', NULL, '["products\\/August2021\\/UWskhEBeI8kwRsMcV4tv.JPG","products\\/August2021\\/11zkzfzg91wp4d6CpH9r.JPG","products\\/August2021\\/gMSS3JbTQVPor7MaihhT.JPG","products\\/August2021\\/oHU0n7D4yOZpDPNkbL4O.JPG"]', 1, 1, 'products/August2021/UWskhEBeI8kwRsMcV4tv-cropped.webp', NULL, NULL, NULL, 1230),
