(927, 'klfm-kk-n', 'Ключниця "Фрог", розмір М', 103, '<p class="MsoNormal"><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">КлФм</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">-КК &ndash; Ключниця &laquo;ФРОГ&raquo;, розмір M</span></strong><strong><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">, шкіра напа, колір коричневий</span></strong></p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Розмір:</span>&nbsp;<span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">10 * 15 см</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">Колір виробу: коричневий</span></p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">Вид&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial;">шкіри:&nbsp;</span><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-ansi-language: RU;">натуральна шкіра напа</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span lang="RU" style="font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-ansi-language: RU;">&middot;<span style="font: 7.0pt ''Times New Roman'';">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<